#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, typeCombo)
#: rc.cpp:434 rc.cpp:453
msgid ""
"The family to where this DTEP belong. There are two families:<br><p><b>XML "
"style</b>:DTEP describing an XML like language</p>\n"
"<p><b>Pseudo type</b>:DTEP describing some other language, where the notion "
"of a tag is not the same as in XML. Examples are <i>PHP, JavaScript, CSS</i>."
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"De Familie, de dit Dokmenttyp-Bewerkpaket (DTBP)  tohöört. Dat gifft twee "
"Familien: <br><p><b>XML-Stil</b>: DTBP, dat en XML-liek Spraak beschrifft</"
"p>\n"
"<p><b>Pseudo-Typ</b>: DTBP, dat anner Spraken beschrifft, de \"Beteker\" "
"anners as XML utdüden doot. Bispelen sünd <i>PHP, JavaScript, CSS</i>.</p>"

