#: rc.cpp:706 rc.cpp:714
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the beginning and closing string for special areas"
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Anfang- un Afsluutbetekers för besünner Rebeden"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1038
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreasEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1050
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1038
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreasEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1050
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#: rc.cpp:709 rc.cpp:717
msgid ""
"The beginning and closing string of special areas, separated by a comma."
"<br>\n"
" Special areas are not parsed according to this DTD's rules, but according "
"to their own rules.<br>\n"
"    A special area can be a pseudo DTD, a comment or something like that, "
"for example <i>&lt;!--&nbsp;--&gt;</i>."
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Anfang- un Afsluttbetekers för besünner Rebeden."
"<br>\n"
" Besünner Rebeden warrt nich na de Regeln vun disse DTD inleest, sünnern na "
"ehr egen Regeln.<br>\n"
"    En besünner Rebeet kann en Pseudo-DTD wesen, en Kommentar oder so wat in "
"de Oort wesen, t.B. <i>&lt;!--&nbsp;--&gt;</i>."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1053
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#: rc.cpp:722
msgid "Special areas:"
msgstr "Besünner Rebeden:"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1063
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreaNamesEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1070
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel28)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1063
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreaNamesEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1070
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel28)
#: rc.cpp:725 rc.cpp:728
msgid "Comma-separated list of the names for the above-defined special areas"
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Naams för de baven fastleggt besünner Rebeden"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1073
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel28)
#: rc.cpp:731
msgid "Special area names:"
msgstr "Besünner Rebeetnaams:"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1083
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1097
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1083
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1097
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:734 rc.cpp:744
msgid "Specifies a tag that defines the start of a special area"
msgstr "Leggt en Beteker as Anfang vun en besünner Rebeet fast"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1087
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1101
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1087
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1101
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:737 rc.cpp:747
msgid ""
"Specifies a tag which defines the start of a special area in the form of "
"<i>tagname(attributename)</i>.<br>\n"
"Example:<b>script(language)</b> means that any <b>&lt;script&gt;</b> tag "
"having a <b>language</b> attribute indicates a special area."
msgstr ""
"Leggt en Beteker as Anfang vun en besünner Rebeet na de Schriefwies "
"<i>Betekernaam(Attributnaam)</i>fast.<br>\n"
"Bispill:<b>skript(spraak)</b> bedüüdt, dat elk <b>&lt;script&gt;</b>-"
"Beteker, de en <b>spraak</b>-Attribut bargt, en besünner Rebeet fastleggt."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1090
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#: rc.cpp:741
msgid "Special tags:"
msgstr "Besünner Betekers:"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1118
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1239
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1118
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1239
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:751 rc.cpp:823
msgid "Tags and attributes defining this DTEP"
msgstr "Betekers un Attributen, de dit DTBP fastleggt"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1125
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1246
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1125
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1246
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:754 rc.cpp:826
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of tags that define this DTEP. The format used is "
"<i>tagname(attribute[defaultvalue])</i>. If the parent (a real) DTEP has a "
"tag with <i>tagname</i> and\n"
"the <i>attribute value</i> of this tag is equal with the name of this DTEP, "
"the tag area\n"
"is parsed according to the rules of this DTEP.<br>\n"
"If <i>[defaultvalue]</i> is present, it means that if the attribute is not "
"present in the tag it is taken as present with <i>value = defaultvalue</i>."
"<br>\n"
"Example: <b>Tags=style(type[text/css])</b> means that both <b>&lt;style&gt;</"
"b> and <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> are treated the same way "
"and the DTEP defined by this tag is named <b>text/css</b>."
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Betekers, de dit Dokmenttyp-Bewerkpaket (DTBP) "
"fastleggt. As Formaat warrt <i>Betekernaam(Attribut[Standardweert])</i> "
"bruukt. Wenn de överornt (un rejell) DTBP en Beteker mit <i>Betekernaam</i> "
"bargt un\n"
"dissen Beteker sien <i>Attributweert</i> liek mit den Naam vun dit DTBP is, "
"warrt dat Beteker-Rebeet\n"
"na de Regeln vun dit DTBP inleest.<br>\n"
"Is en <i>[Standardweert]</i> angeven, warrt de Betekers mit en fehlen "
"Attribut so bruukt, as stunn dat Attribut mit <i>Weert = Standardweert</i> "
"dor binnen.<br>\n"
"Bispill: <b>Betekers=style(type[text/css])</b> bedüüdt, dat <b>&lt;style&gt;"
"</b> un <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> liek behannelt warrt un "
"dat DTBP, dat mit dissen Beteker fastleggt warrt, <b>text/css</b> heet."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1128
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#: rc.cpp:761
msgid "Definition tags:"
msgstr "Definitschoon-Betekers:"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1138
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel20)
