#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structEndEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1277
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel25)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1267
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structEndEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1277
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel25)
#: rc.cpp:844 rc.cpp:850
msgid ""
"A string specifying the end of a structure, like <b>}</b> in many cases."
msgstr ""
"En Tekenkeed, de dat Enn vun en Struktuur angifft, liek faken <b>}</b>."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1280
